---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About CalcForDIY — Free Home Improvement Calculators"
  description="CalcForDIY is a free collection of 68+ calculators for DIY home improvement projects, built by tradespeople and homeowners to eliminate guesswork at the hardware store."
>
  <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500 mb-4">
    <a href="/" class="hover:text-blue-600">Home</a>
    <span>/</span>
    <span>About</span>
  </div>

  <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">About CalcForDIY</h1>

  <div class="prose max-w-3xl text-gray-700 space-y-5">

    <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-xl p-6 mb-8">
      <p class="text-blue-900 text-lg font-medium mb-0">CalcForDIY is a free collection of <strong>68+ calculators</strong> built for homeowners, DIY enthusiasts, and contractors who need fast, accurate material estimates for home improvement projects.</p>
    </div>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">Why We Built This</h2>
    <p>
      Every DIY project starts with the same frustrating question: <em>"How much do I need to buy?"</em> You measure your room, drive to the hardware store, stare at a wall of products, and either buy too much (wasting money) or too little (making a second trip). We built CalcForDIY to eliminate that guesswork entirely.
    </p>
    <p>
      Every calculator on this site runs entirely in your browser. Nothing is uploaded to a server. No account is required. No hidden fees. You enter your measurements, and you get an instant, printable material list.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">What We Cover</h2>
    <p>Our calculators span the most common DIY home improvement categories:</p>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3 my-4">
      <a href="/calculators" class="block bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-3 text-center hover:border-blue-400 transition-colors">
        <div class="font-semibold text-gray-900 text-sm">Tile</div>
        <div class="text-xs text-gray-500">Shower, wall, grout, thinset</div>
      </a>
      <a href="/calculators" class="block bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-3 text-center hover:border-blue-400 transition-colors">
        <div class="font-semibold text-gray-900 text-sm">Flooring</div>
        <div class="text-xs text-gray-500">Laminate, hardwood, carpet</div>
      </a>
      <a href="/calculators" class="block bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-3 text-center hover:border-blue-400 transition-colors">
        <div class="font-semibold text-gray-900 text-sm">Walls</div>
        <div class="text-xs text-gray-500">Drywall, framing, shiplap</div>
      </a>
      <a href="/calculators" class="block bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-3 text-center hover:border-blue-400 transition-colors">
        <div class="font-semibold text-gray-900 text-sm">Paint</div>
        <div class="text-xs text-gray-500">Interior, exterior, textured</div>
      </a>
      <a href="/calculators" class="block bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-3 text-center hover:border-blue-400 transition-colors">
        <div class="font-semibold text-gray-900 text-sm">Lighting</div>
        <div class="text-xs text-gray-500">Recessed, outdoor, string</div>
      </a>
      <a href="/calculators" class="block bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-3 text-center hover:border-blue-400 transition-colors">
        <div class="font-semibold text-gray-900 text-sm">Garden</div>
        <div class="text-xs text-gray-500">Mulch, soil, topsoil, seed</div>
      </a>
      <a href="/calculators" class="block bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-3 text-center hover:border-blue-400 transition-colors">
        <div class="font-semibold text-gray-900 text-sm">Concrete</div>
        <div class="text-xs text-gray-500">Slabs, fence posts, rebar</div>
      </a>
      <a href="/calculators" class="block bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-3 text-center hover:border-blue-400 transition-colors">
        <div class="font-semibold text-gray-900 text-sm">Utilities</div>
        <div class="text-xs text-gray-500">AC, furnace, generator, LED</div>
      </a>
    </div>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">Our Sources &amp; Methodology</h2>
    <p>
      Accuracy matters. If a calculator tells you to buy 4 bags of grout and you actually need 6, that is a failed tool. Every formula on CalcForDIY is sourced from published industry standards:
    </p>
    <ul class="space-y-2">
      <li><strong>Tile Council of North America (TCNA)</strong> — tile waste factors, grout coverage rates, and thinset consumption standards.</li>
      <li><strong>National Wood Flooring Association (NWFA)</strong> — hardwood and laminate waste factor guidelines by room complexity and installation pattern.</li>
      <li><strong>Manufacturer Technical Data Sheets</strong> — from Mapei, LATICRETE, Quikrete, and other major brands for product-specific coverage rates.</li>
      <li><strong>International Residential Code (IRC)</strong> — for framing stud spacing, structural load requirements, and electrical calculations.</li>
      <li><strong>Illuminating Engineering Society (IES)</strong> — for recommended foot-candle levels by room type used in our lighting calculators.</li>
      <li><strong>U.S. Energy Information Administration (EIA)</strong> — for average utility rates used as default values in our energy cost calculators.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      We continually cross-reference our formulas against real-world results. If you find an error in any calculator, please let us know immediately.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">Contact Us</h2>
    <p>
      Have a question, found a bug, or want to suggest a new calculator? We would love to hear from you.
    </p>
    <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-5">
      <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">Email</p>
      <p><a href="mailto:invictusetfortis@gmail.com" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">invictusetfortis@gmail.com</a></p>
    </div>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-4">
      We typically respond within 1-2 business days. For calculator suggestions, please include the specific formula or use case you have in mind so we can evaluate it quickly.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>